  "description": "Arcturus.Extensions.Validation.AspNetCore adds first-class ASP.NET Core support for Arcturus.Extensions.Validation. It provides lightweight extensions for MVC and Minimal APIs to convert ValidationResult/ValidationResult{T} into IActionResult/IResult, apply consistent HTTP status code conventions, and generate ProblemDetails-based error responses. Designed for clean, centralized validation handling in ASP.NET Core apps on .NET 8/9.",
